{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ICU: Anomaly</strong> is a psychological horror observation game where you patrol the looping halls of a hospital\u2019s ICU. Ride the elevator between floors, search for anomalies, and decide what\u2019s real before the loop consumes you. Miss too many changes, and reality begins to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Looping hospital corridors</strong> that shift and distort with each cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elevator system</strong> connecting floors, adding new routes and anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observation-based gameplay</strong> where noticing subtle changes is your only defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere-driven horror</strong> with no combat\u2014just focus, memory, and tension</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep track of reality long enough to break the loop, or will the ICU claim you forever?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076370?t=1759512078","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076370?t=1759512078","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076370/49ba4404c5025a5da1bd2ac0c089f264e3543698/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759512078","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076370/49ba4404c5025a5da1bd2ac0c089f264e3543698/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759512078","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ICU: Anomaly</strong> is a psychological horror observa